WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.010 --> 00:00:02.514
Installation

2
00:00:02.514 --> 00:00:05.251
Open Settings → Community plugins

3
00:00:05.251 --> 00:00:07.626
Turn off restricted mode

4
00:00:07.626 --> 00:00:14.970
Browse and search for BRAT

5
00:00:14.970 --> 00:00:24.804
Install it, then enable it

6
00:00:24.804 --> 00:00:31.247
Run BRAT's Add a beta plugin command

7
00:00:31.247 --> 00:00:36.720
Enter the repository sblabkribb/labnoteo

8
00:00:36.720 --> 00:00:42.033
Pick latest under Select a version

9
00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:46.685
Press Add plugin to install and enable it

10
00:00:46.685 --> 00:00:54.376
Workflows, Samples and scan icons appear in the ribbon
